brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net can you build something like this? i'm thinking you enter a handle and it gets the list of accounts you're following, then watches some firehose for those accounts. it blasts anything it sees at the 500 wpm. maybe keep a recent buffer of 2000 words, keep looping. go bot go!

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@angussoftware.dev: In my revolutionary BlueSky app, the pace at which you receive posts will speed up rather than slowing down. Your whole feed is just every post of a feed in order of words, one word at a time on the center of the screen, at a blazing 500 wpm
